                ({{ banner.dateText }}).\r
              </p>\r
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs leading-snug opacity-90">\r
                You'll be locked out if {{ parentOwnerName() || 'the owner' }} doesn't renew before then. Please remind them.\r
              </p>\r
            }\r
          </div>\r
        </div>\r
